- Implement on existing **`phase-6-kanban`** (still open) as a follow-up commit, or `phase-6b-hover-add-column` from latest phase-6 tip if you prefer isolation before merge. **Default: stay on `phase-6-kanban`.**
- Persist the plan as [`.cursor/plans/2026-07-phase-6b-hover-add-column.mdc`](.cursor/plans/2026-07-phase-6b-hover-add-column.mdc) when implementation starts.
- End with a short QA checklist (hover delay, insert between columns, cancel, DnD suppression, empty board, overflow pages).

## Exit criteria

- Top Add column UI gone.  
- Hover blank carousel area ≥500ms → prompt at nearest insert slot.  
- Click → name → column appears at that index.  
- Esc/empty blur cancels without create.  
- Card drag does not flash the prompt.  
- Server refuses nothing new beyond validation; insert reindexes correctly.